# Google Drive sync (bring-your-own-storage) — server-side token exchange.
#
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com
# 2. Enable the Google Drive API.
# 3. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (type "Web application").
# 4. Authorized redirect URIs:
#      http://localhost:5173/oauth-callback
#      https://your-prod-domain/oauth-callback
# 5. Local dev: fill in below (used by `npm run dev` via Vite middleware).
#    Production: set the same two vars in Vercel project settings.
VITE_GDRIVE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional hardening: comma-separated origins allowed to call /api/google-token
# (defaults to accepting all in dev; set e.g. "https://your-prod-domain" in prod)
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
